OL,3,GNEWSAFighter 'living the dream' after
OL,4,AUFC contract win
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mixed martial artist says he is
OL,7,Fliving the dream after securing a
OL,8,Fcontract with the sport's top
OL,9,Forganisation.
OL,11,FGeorge Staines, from Hull, secured his
OL,12,Fspot with the Ultimate Fighting
OL,13,FChampionship (UFC) with a 61-second win
OL,14,Fover Loai Abushaar in Las Vegas in
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,F"The whole experience was mad. I was
OL,18,Fconfident I would get the win but not
OL,19,Fas quickly as I did and to then hear
OL,20,Fthat I'm now in the UFC was surreal,"
OL,21,FStaines said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
