OL,3,GNEWSAFighter 'living the dream' after
OL,4,AUFC contract win
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 26-year-old said he hoped to make
OL,7,Fhis official UFC debut with a fight
OL,8,Fbefore the end of 2026 in the United
OL,9,FArab Emirates or in Las Vegas.
